      "text": [
        "703 - وَقَالَ أَبُو جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ بَنَى مَسْجِداً كَمَفْحَصِ قَطَاةٍ بَنَى اَللَّهُ لَهُ بَيْتاً فِي اَلْجَنَّةِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.703 - Imam Muhammad ibn Ali Al-Baqir (as) said:\n\"Whoever builds a mosque as small as a sandgrouse’s nest, Allah (swt) will build for them a house in Paradise.\""
        ]
      }
